Comment: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:00.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,{Source: OCR of hardcoded English subs ([1015-1017] Onigashima 30 - This is Otama!!.mp4); opening lyrics omitted}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Edited by fedew
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.28,0:01:24.08,Credits-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an8}Subtitles by HatSubs
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.06,0:01:48.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You heard him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.90,0:01:51.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't give up the fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.54,0:02:09.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Satisfied, son of Oden?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.13,0:02:15.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat'll "best" me?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.67,0:02:21.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wano's borders will open?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.22,0:02:23.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And everybody gets to live\Nhappily ever after?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.97,0:02:26.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You gotta be dreamin'!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.52,0:02:30.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.73,0:02:32.40,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...win, I swear it!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.73,0:02:37.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It will not be Luffy alone!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.74,0:02:40.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My people shall see to\Nour victory!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.58,0:02:44.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fool of a boy...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.50,0:02:52.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Momonosuke-sama!\NIf it is our time, we shall meet our end together!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.80,0:02:58.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ripe-Ripe Jutsu!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.53,0:03:28.70,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And so Momonosukeeeee...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.70,0:03:30.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...fell as well!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.12,0:03:34.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Indeed, the de facto leader\Nof the enemy faction is dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.42,0:03:36.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If we announce it\Nto all of Onigashima,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.79,0:03:40.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,those filthy samurai will\Nlose all will to fight this time!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.34,0:03:44.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're right!\NLet's crush their spiriiits!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.76,0:03:45.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!\NHe's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.85,0:03:46.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!\NHe's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.01,0:03:47.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Big Bro!\NHe's alive!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.22,0:03:51.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's keep heading for the\NPerformance Floor stage, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.89,0:03:52.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yep!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.73,0:03:56.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy's hanging tough,\Nso we'd better do the same!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.27,0:03:59.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm happy for Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.36,0:04:00.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Wha?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:01.28,0:04:03.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that you, Klima Takt?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.45,0:04:08.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What in the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.54,0:04:11.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Spoke?!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.33,0:04:13.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's so cute!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.88,0:04:22.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's gonna "best" Kaido?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:22.47,0:04:30.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All I wanted to do was\Nbutcher him myself, that's all
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.23,0:04:38.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You know,\Nthe more you work with him,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.98,0:04:46.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,the more you get this odd feeling\Nhe'll somehow pull through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:47.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's Big Mom we're fighting...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.37,0:04:51.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Grow up, Eustasser...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.21,0:04:58.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's make this a...\Ntemporary partnership.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.79,0:05:03.30,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1538,428)}2nd Floor\NNami, Usopp and O-Tama's POV
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.47,0:05:09.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Maybe I'm too much of a genius\Nto have realized it myself?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.56,0:05:14.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But it talked!\NThe Klima Takt I created!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.60,0:05:18.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, like I've been saying, it's me!\NEx-Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.19,0:05:23.48,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So how did you\Nturn into the Klima Takt?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.07,0:05:25.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At that moment...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.99,0:05:29.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Before I knew it,\Nmy soul was leaving my body...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.66,0:05:32.74,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go on, eat up, Hera!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.62,0:05:39.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I was barely hanging on\Nas that Hera girl was about to absorb me...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.80,0:05:46.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Some pity Black Balls,\Ncoming your way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.42,0:05:48.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Chow on these and run!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:49.93,0:05:50.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.55,0:05:51.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.26,0:05:55.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But then you reached out\Nto me with the Klima Takt...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.02,0:05:56.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eat them, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.10,0:05:58.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.81,0:06:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks for being my meal\NZeus-senpai!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.11,0:06:08.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And it seems like at the instant Hera bit down,\NI was pushed into this baton!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.53,0:06:09.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Check me out now!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.70,0:06:12.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm born again!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.58,0:06:16.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What? Ugh, can I maybe not\Nhave an annoying talking weapon
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.87,0:06:21.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah!\NYou still haven't let me off the hook!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.38,0:06:23.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Just get out already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.84,0:06:28.67,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But I can't get out,\Nnot without Mama's power...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.76,0:06:38.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, hey!\NThere's the stage!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.31,0:06:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.98,0:06:44.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,To all those here at Onigashima,\Nmay I have your attention, pleeeease!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.52,0:06:48.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The enemy general, Momo-
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.36,0:06:49.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's the Straw Hats!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.61,0:06:52.03,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ah, Usohachi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.70,0:06:53.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti-Mortar!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.66,0:06:56.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.79,0:07:03.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It ever so is all\Nthis runt's fault, is it not?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.59,0:07:05.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.59,0:07:09.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,All 'cause of her, it's been nothing but\Nbetrayal after betrayal by our underlings!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.88,0:07:13.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And to top it all,\Nshe even had Big Mom under her thumb!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.39,0:07:17.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She's still standing even after\Ntaking that attack head on?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.89,0:07:20.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Pay-Pay got all beat up\Nbecause of you!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.89,0:07:23.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What part of "Stop"\Ndid you not understand!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.61,0:07:28.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uho!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.65,0:07:31.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can do that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.45,0:07:35.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami, just use the Takt like you always do!\NI'm gonna help!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.87,0:07:38.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Her skin's just way too hard!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.41,0:07:41.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But Mama's attack really\Nmessed her up inside!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.13,0:07:46.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can knock her out\Nwith a Lightning Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.59,0:07:48.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,We can't! That's overkill!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.47,0:07:55.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Tama would get caught in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.60,0:07:58.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon, Black Kabuto...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.64,0:08:01.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I really need you right now...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.56,0:08:05.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're all dead meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.44,0:08:08.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure-Kill Green Star:
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.02,0:08:09.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sargasso!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.15,0:08:13.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There, they're split up!\NNow, Nami!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.53,0:08:13.95,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.16,0:08:14.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.99,0:08:17.99,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(478,531)}Guest parlor\NCastle interior
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:21.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Even after they lost\NStraw Hat Luffy,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.54,0:08:26.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,none of them\Nsurrendered.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.00,0:08:26.00,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(356,662)}The world's most powerful intelligence agency
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.88,0:08:29.84,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yes. The current situation shows...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.25,0:08:35.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...a total of\N5,000 troops incapacitated.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:41.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Animal Kingdom Pirates had 24,000\Nfit for combat, and the rebels 3,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.48,0:08:47.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However, all of the Pleasures and Waiters\Non the Performance Floor...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.94,0:08:50.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...turned against Queen-sama,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.03,0:08:53.03,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(962,100)}so 4,000 troops changed sides.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.53,0:08:58.53,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(961,140)}As a result,\Nthe Animal Kingdom Pirates number 20,000,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.53,0:09:01.54,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(963,95)}and the rebels 7,000.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.45,0:09:05.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The diminishing gap in army strength\Nis most unexpected...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.46,0:09:09.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The situation is\Nwholly unpredictable
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.17,0:09:13.80,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And we are in possession of intelligence\Nthat may further alter conditions...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.34,0:09:19.97,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,H-Here they come!\NIt's the Gifters!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.97,0:09:21.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This is really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.06,0:09:25.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gifters Elite Corps,\Nreporting in!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.98,0:09:28.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Is it true that the Pleasures and Waiters\Non this floor...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.94,0:09:32.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...revolted against Queen-sama?!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.44,0:09:32.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.44,0:09:33.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, sure is!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:33.65,0:09:40.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who do they think they even are?\NThey're just some expendable trash!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:40.62,0:09:44.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Get rid of all the\Nbackstabbers on this floor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.84,0:09:54.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gorilla Punch: Starring My Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.84,0:09:57.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Weather Egg!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.01,0:10:00.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Come forth, thundercloud!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.39,0:10:06.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaaay!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.81,0:10:08.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Zeus?!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.48,0:10:11.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not exactly,\Nnot anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.07,0:10:17.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,C'mon Nami,\Ngimme a new name already!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.24,0:10:18.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Err...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.99,0:10:23.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What\NWhat is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.24,0:10:24.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wanna know!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.87,0:10:29.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Fluff!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.13,0:10:35.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am the mighty Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.34,0:10:40.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Nami's right-hand man!\NPrepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:40.13,0:10:41.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's do this, Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.22,0:10:46.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You damn dirty...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.02,0:10:47.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.89,0:10:51.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,This little game of\Ncat and-mouse with you...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.23,0:10:52.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...is gonna be over after this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.48,0:10:56.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Lightning Blast!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.29,0:11:11.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're kidding!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:11.21,0:11:13.08,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it's over, all right...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.00,0:11:17.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it's not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:17.42,0:11:18.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, it's not over!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.38,0:11:20.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's not over 'til\NI've done my job...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:20.72,0:11:22.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...and hit my target!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.36,0:11:38.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:49.50,0:11:54.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ulti-sama has been\Neliminateeeed!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.92,0:11:57.13,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,She follows Page One-sama...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.55,0:12:03.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,and now two members\Nof the Flying Six have been done iiiin!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.01,0:12:04.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whaaaa?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.68,0:12:05.93,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No freaking way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.93,0:12:11.35,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's never happened before!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.35,0:12:15.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Bao Huang-sama,\Nall of Onigashima heard you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.98,0:12:17.02,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Oh, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.02,0:12:19.98,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I announced it by accident!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.03,0:12:27.99,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was a total lie!\NI take it baaack!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.41,0:12:29.66,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,In that case...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.66,0:12:30.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:30.87,0:12:32.58,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sure-Kill Green Star:
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.58,0:12:32.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:33.87,0:12:34.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Devil!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.21,0:12:39.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Huuuh?!\NWhat's this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.59,0:12:48.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the heck\Nis this monsterrrr?!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.10,0:12:53.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey, Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.31,0:12:57.44,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I don't know how it all works,\Nbut that one's a transmitter!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.90,0:13:00.86,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Your commands reach\Nthe whole island!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.28,0:13:02.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Speak!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.36,0:13:04.32,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kay!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.51,0:13:23.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.71,0:13:24.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.34,0:13:27.43,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm O-Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.97,0:13:30.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Was that a kid?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.18,0:13:32.60,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Tama-chan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.60,0:13:35.27,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why's she here on Onigashima?!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.27,0:13:38.81,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There she is! Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.33,0:13:59.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Drink up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.54,0:14:01.92,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Sing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:02.34,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1700,186)}Flower\NCapital
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.83,0:14:02.34,Captions-207+,,0,0,0,,{\an5\pos(1697,627)}Land of\NWano
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.10,0:14:22.61,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gorgeous, is it not, O-Toko?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.73,0:14:31.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The Fire Festival is held\Nin memory of the deceased...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.07,0:14:34.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I wonder if Daddy's watching?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.29,0:14:38.54,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye, indeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:42.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,The skies are quite clear...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.21,0:14:49.88,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I am sure he is watching over you,\Nand the fate of our land...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.51,0:14:53.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Uh-huh!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.11,0:15:11.20,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Someone's there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.20,0:15:12.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Whuh?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.11,0:15:15.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There is somebody there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.66,0:15:18.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,How can you hear a voice\Nunder the sea?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.62,0:15:21.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who cares,\Ngive him a hand already!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.08,0:15:24.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,On the double!\NIs he alive?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:27.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's a freakin' brat...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.42,0:15:30.42,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...doing on the battlefield?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.84,0:15:33.34,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What happened, Bao Huang?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.34,0:15:34.68,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Who're you?!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.52,0:15:39.89,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,O-Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.89,0:15:41.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Tama, pull yourself together!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.33,0:16:01.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not even the tiniest\Ngripe out of you, huh, Jinbe?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.12,0:16:05.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,At first, it was 5,000\Nagainst 30,000!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.63,0:16:08.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Naturally, you outnumber us,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.30,0:16:11.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would be foolish to assume\NI'd be fighting you one-on-one.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.76,0:16:14.39,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've got a good grasp\Nof the situation!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.39,0:16:15.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Royal pain in my ass!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.47,0:16:21.10,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It's our job not to let you\Ntop officers go unchecked!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.39,0:16:25.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They just keep comin'...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.61,0:16:31.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no end to\Nthese underlings!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.15,0:16:36.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can be prepared to die\Nall you want...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.49,0:16:40.45,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But in the end,\Nit's a game of numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.45,0:16:44.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's what makes this total war!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:45.96,0:16:48.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't blame me...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.76,0:16:57.09,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That brat!\NShe's still messin' around up there?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.09,0:16:59.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Hey! I want her yanked down\Nfrom there yesterday!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.85,0:17:00.72,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.72,0:17:01.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.31,0:17:03.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You can do it, O-Tama!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.18,0:17:04.23,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Go for it!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.85,0:17:08.94,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,T-To all my friends\Nthat ate my Kibi Dango!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.94,0:17:19.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm asking y'all a favor!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.46,0:17:29.59,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's all take out Kaido, together!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:44.22,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ain't no way us\NAnimal Kingdom Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.22,0:17:47.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...'re gonna follow orders\Nfrom some runt!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.61,0:17:54.11,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Certainly, at once, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.49,0:17:57.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,It would be our pleasure!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.45,0:17:58.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Down with Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.07,0:18:01.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Why, ya little!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.16,0:18:03.49,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You all lost it or somethin'?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:05.45,0:18:07.96,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Briscola-san, what's the matter?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:07.96,0:18:11.17,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's deal with those\Ndirty traitors already!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.29,0:18:15.26,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Easy as pie, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.71,0:18:18.38,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Gorilla Punch: Starring My Fist!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.63,0:18:20.76,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For our Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.76,0:18:25.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Right, you heard her orders!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:26.18,0:18:28.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Let's get in there!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.19,0:18:29.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.06,0:18:33.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Leave it to me, Master!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.57,0:18:35.78,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's something weird\Nabout the Gifters!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.78,0:18:37.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What are they doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.45,0:18:42.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Down with Kaido! Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.33,0:18:46.83,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Follow me, folks!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.79,0:18:57.05,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our strength combined...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.77,0:19:13.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Thanks, everybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:21.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What the hell is this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.41,0:19:22.82,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Like I said,\Nhe's a goner.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.82,0:19:25.91,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And like I said, no curses!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.91,0:19:28.75,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Without the Captain here,\Nhow do we even handle this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.75,0:19:30.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aaarrrgh!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.16,0:19:32.71,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,For now, let's clear his lungs!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.71,0:19:35.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,One, two!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.22,0:19:41.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Step aside!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.31,0:19:57.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Think you might've been\Na little too... forceful?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.40,0:20:00.53,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,He'll be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.53,0:20:02.57,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,'Cause he's rubber.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.45,0:20:07.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:08.12,0:20:09.62,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.62,0:20:14.04,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he's totally a goner...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.92,0:20:22.01,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So h-hi... So h-hiiii...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.01,0:20:25.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,So hiiiigh!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.18,0:20:27.85,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Entrust everything to\Nmy Ninja Arts!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:29.47,0:20:32.06,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Ninja Art: Great Kite!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.65,0:20:41.90,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Our first task:\Nlanding somewhere safe!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.82,0:20:49.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That was frightening...!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.41,0:20:52.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I suppose this means\NI managed to escape, aye?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.00,0:20:53.87,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.87,0:20:56.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...what is going on!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.12,0:20:59.46,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,My subjects...\NAre they still all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.01,0:21:13.31,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kiku! Kin'emon!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.45,0:21:26.28,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.20,0:21:34.33,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,That's "Father" to you...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.33,0:21:35.50,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.08,0:21:38.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,No, I have come to\Nsever those chains!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.04,0:21:44.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You've come to "sever the chains"\Nbetween father and son, eh?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.98,0:21:59.19,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't make me laugh!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.73,0:22:02.15,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,What's left for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.61,0:22:05.07,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat's disappeared\Nbeneath the waves...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.70,0:22:10.12,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,And so has the\Nson of Kozuki Oden...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.58,0:22:16.41,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,If you have the will to fight,\Nyou should've been there to protect what needs protecting!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.41,0:22:21.25,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Neither Luffy nor Momonosuke-kun\Nare in need of my protection!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.96,0:22:23.00,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,They are...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.84,0:22:25.21,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...allies,\Nalongside whom I fight!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:25.80,0:22:28.51,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You little snot nosed brat...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.51,0:22:32.18,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You're really planning to break off\Nyour shackles and leave?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.85,0:22:36.52,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Aye! I will set out to sea\Nwith Luffy!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.52,0:22:39.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,After I have kicked you\Nout of this country,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.69,0:22:40.56,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.20,0:22:57.16,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Not just any place'll do, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.91,0:23:03.79,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I'm stayin' right here\Nbecause this is Wano!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.21,0:23:08.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,There's no way you can beat me!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:10.59,0:23:14.30,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,You will be the\NShogun of Wano, Yamato!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.52,0:23:17.47,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I refuse!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.02,0:23:20.73,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I know that I cannot defeat you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.73,0:23:21.69,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,However...!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.69,0:23:25.65,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Luffy is the man\NKozuki Oden was waiting for!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.86,0:23:30.36,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Until his return,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.86,0:23:33.24,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,I shall be holding you here!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:35.12,0:23:38.37,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,Don't expect me to\Ngo easy on you...
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.50,0:23:43.63,Main-207+,,0,0,0,,...Yamato!
